  "summary": "Messages for an address with a quoted local part are sent to a different address",
  "details": "A message whose sender or recipient has a quoted local part is sent with a\ndifferent address in its envelope than the one the application was given:\n`\"d \"@example.com` becomes `d@example.com`. Someone who can choose such an\naddress can have a message delivered to another mailbox than the one the\napplication validated.\n\nAddresses without a quoted local part are not affected.",
